# Request: how far in the past the frame was captured (the MCU does a buffered
# time-lookup keyed on this delay). Mirrors the wire type (uint8 ms).
uint8 frame_delay_ms
---
# Response: the camera-to-ballistic transform. matrix is the 4x4 row-major.
bool success
float32 yaw
float32 pitch
float32[16] matrix
